      "observed": "R29 10k connects the gate node of ATO-valve MOSFET T7 to GND, and T1 is an NPN common-emitter stage that can only pull that same gate node low.",
      "expected": "The gate needs a pull-up to +3V3, as in the main-pump driver where R45 10k pulls the gate high, so the NPN can pull it low to turn off and release it high to turn on. The specification describes the ATO valve as a low-side switch driven through a BT3904 pre-driver.",
